 the diagnostic triage of women with an abnormal Pap smear</article-title><source>Int J Gynec Obstet</source><year>1998</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>50</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Gynec Obstet||61|45||bib21|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vassilakos</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Management of suboptimal cytologic smears</article-title><source>Acta Cytol</source><year>1998b</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>1481</fpage>(letter)<!--PubMed citation query: 'Acta Cytol||42|1481||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9850666</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vassilakos</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Carrel</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Petignat</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Boulvain</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Campana</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of automated primary screening on liquid-based, thin-layer preparations</article-title><source>Acta Cytol</source><year>2001</year>(in press)</citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walboomers</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobs</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Manos</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bosch</surname><given-names>FX</given-names></name><name><surname>Kummer</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Shah</surname><given-names>KV</given-names></name><name><surname>Snijders</surname><given-names>PJF</given-names></name><name><surname>Peto</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Meijer</surname><given